<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>my babydoll</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Artemas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">yustyna</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">592myufKPcidAJLT2P8QXw</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.735" end="00:06.479">And there she goes, my babydoll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.479" end="00:10.760">I told ya, it's not over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.760" end="00:15.350">You're the one I see, make me feel complete</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.350" end="00:19.931">Girl, I don't want peace, so go and make a scene (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.931" end="00:24.600">I want you mad, want you reckless, baby show your teeth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.600" end="00:29.803">Before I fall asleep, lookin' up at me, ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.803" end="00:34.546">And there she goes, my babydoll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.546" end="00:39.058">I told ya, it's not over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.058" end="00:44.025">And there you go, you know you're mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.025" end="00:50.124">I told ya, you see, it's not over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.124" end="00:54.711">Baby turn up for me, don't you stop touching me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.711" end="00:57.612">Why'd you stop touching me? (Uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.612" end="01:02.234">And there she goes, my babydoll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.234" end="01:06.889">I told ya, it's not over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.889" end="01:11.343">You're so sweet (Sweet), you're in my jeans</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.343" end="01:15.993">Before I left your sheets (Roll out), girl, I think you peeked</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.993" end="01:20.663">Let me see that smile, baby, show your teeth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.663" end="01:25.628">You lookin' up at me, naturally, you're trying your best</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.628" end="01:27.925">You know, you better</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.925" end="01:32.594">And there she goes, my babydoll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.594" end="01:37.333">I told ya, it's not over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.333" end="01:41.843">And there you go, you know you're mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.843" end="01:48.567">I told ya, you see, it's not over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.567" end="01:52.939">Baby turn up for me, don't you stop touching me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.939" end="01:55.990">Why'd you stop touching me? (Uh-uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.990" end="02:00.958">And there she goes, my babydoll</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.958" end="02:06.993">I told ya, it's not over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.993" end="02:11.659">Baby turn up for me, don't you stop touching me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.659" end="02:14.181">Why'd you stop touching me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.181" end="02:21.742">Oh-ooh, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.742" end="02:25.742">It's not over, no</p></div></body></tt>